          "parts": [
            "Do you mean a **bandana worn as a left arm band**? Here are a few style directions depending on the vibe you\u2019re going for:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Classic Folded Arm Band  \n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"bandana tied around left bicep\",\"red bandana arm band style\",\"black bandana tied on arm fashion\",\"bandana folded into strip and tied around arm\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**How to do it:**\n- Fold bandana diagonally into a triangle  \n- Roll into a long strip  \n- Wrap around upper left bicep  \n- Tie a small knot (let the ends hang or tuck them in)\n\n**Vibe:** edgy, effortless, slightly rebellious\n\n---\n\n### 2. Slim Minimal Wrap  \n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"thin bandana arm wrap style\",\"minimalist bandana arm band\",\"neutral colored bandana arm style\",\"fashion arm scarf wrap minimal look\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**How to do it:**\n- Fold into a thinner strip  \n- Wrap twice for a cleaner look  \n- Tuck knot underneath\n\n**Vibe:** subtle, editorial, high-fashion\n\n---\n\n### 3. Statement / Symbolic Wrap  \n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"query\":[\"woman wearing bandana on arm looking powerful\",\"symbolic arm bandana fashion\",\"bandana arm band strong aesthetic\",\"cinematic fashion bandana arm wrap\"],\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**Vibe:** powerful, intentional, symbolic  \nThis works beautifully if you're using it for:\n- A photoshoot\n- A transformation theme\n- A bold brand aesthetic\n\n---\n\nIf this is for a shoot or content piece, tell me:\n- What color outfit?\n- What mood?\n- Casual or cinematic?\n\nI can style it specifically to match your look."
          ]
        },
